  "description": "folio8 for .NET: render and validate .folio templates with the folio8 engine as a native library. Byte-identical to the Go engine, from .NET Framework 4.6 through modern .NET, on Windows x86 and x64 and on Linux x64 and arm64 (glibc 2.28 or newer; musl is not supported). Ships all four native architectures and the eleven shipped font faces. Design templates at https://folio8.report.",
